flowchart TD
  Need[Need to notify others?] --> Q1{Must a human wait for the answer now?}
  Q1 -->|Yes| Sync[Request/reply API or UI path: not EDA]
  Q1 -->|No| Q2{Is the payload just committed record CRUD?}
  Q2 -->|Yes| CDC[Change Data Capture]
  Q2 -->|Custom business event| PE[Custom platform event]
  PE --> Q3{Must subscriber see committed rows?}
  Q3 -->|Yes| After[Publish After Commit]
  Q3 -->|Log even on rollback| Imm[Publish Immediately: watch row locks]
